What Goes on a Wedding Invitation (and When to Send It)

Every invitation needs:
• the hosts and the couple's names;
• the date, start time and ceremony location;
• reception details;
• how to RSVP and by when;
• any dress code;
• your wedding website.

Mail them about 8 weeks before, set the RSVP deadline 3–4 weeks before, and order one per household plus 15–20 extras.

Read the full guide: https://bridalteam.com/guides/wedding-invitations-guide?utm_source=facebook&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=2026-12&utm_content=2026-12-23-noon-what-goes-on-an-invitation
